From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: usb: wch,ch334: Allow hard wired devices on the ports

The CH334 hub node is used for hubs with a soldered device on a port.
usb-hub.yaml already allows such child nodes, but additionalProperties
rejects them. Use unevaluatedProperties as the other hub bindings do.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/wch,ch334.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/wch,ch334.yaml
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ required:
   - compatible
   - reg
 
-additionalProperties: false
+unevaluatedProperties: false
 
 examples:
   - |
